MIT business modules
--------------------
The following project-owned modules are licensed under the MIT License:
  src/basis.mjs
  src/records.mjs
  src/export.mjs
  src/tasks.mjs
  src/translation-model.mjs
  src/adapters/*.mjs

These modules implement translation, document records, frozen exports and
format adapters. They currently ship in the main package. Shared registries,
protocols, entry points and other core files retain LGPL-3.0-or-later.
Future independent plugins declare their own license (for example GPL or MIT);
this is not a choice of license for files already covered by this notice.

